DOOM for BuzzOS

This application uses the GPL doomgeneric engine. Game data is separate.
Place a legally obtained DOOM shareware IWAD at:

  /fs/games/doom/doom1.wad

Run make doom-install on the host to download the verified Doom 1.9
shareware WAD and install it into the BuzzOS disk image automatically.

Controls:
  Arrow keys  move and turn
  X           fire
  Space       use/open
  C           run
  V           strafe modifier
  M           menu/back
  Enter       select

Sound effects use the native BuzzOS AC97 bus-master PCM driver. Music synthesis is not
implemented in DOOM yet; use the Music application to test WAV playback.
